{'symbol': 'GEHC', 'date': '2023-01-05 08:45:00', 'title': 'GE HEALTHCARE NAMES HEALTH TECH PIONEER TAHA KASS-HOUT FIRST CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER', 'text': "CHICAGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--GE HEALTHCARE (NASDAQ: GEHC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT TAHA KASS-HOUT MD, MS HAS BEEN NAMED CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER (CTO) TO LEAD THE COMPANY'S NEW SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY ORGANIZATION. THE NEW GROUP, ALONGSIDE THE CREATION OF THE CTO ROLE, DEMONSTRATES GE HEALTHCARE'S COMMITMENT TO DRIVING INNOVATION, GROWTH, AND VALUE THROUGH RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT."}